# Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser
#   Tracked: spec/, src/, docs/ (including the generated MiniLang.gv / .svg deliverables),
#   examples/, tests/ (public and student), tools/, CMakeLists.txt, Lab1.md, README.md.
#   Ignored: build folders (above), the RE/flex scanner (above), and scratch input files
#   created at the lab root to try the lexer (e.g. `minilang --tokens t.txt`).
/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/*.txt
!/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/CMakeLists.txt
/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/*.tokens
/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/*.expected
/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/Lab1-MiniLang-Lexer-Parser/docs/*.pdf

